{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>It devours its inhabitants.</b> Everywhere we passed we found them burying their dead, and the Holy One, blessed be He, did it for the good — so as to distract them with their mourning and they would not pay attention to us." "<b>Men of measure.</b> Great and tall, and one must give their measurement — like Goliath, ״his height was six cubits and a span״ (1 Samuel 17), and likewise ״אִישׁ מָדוֹן״ (2 Samuel 21), ״אִישׁ מִדָּה״ (1 Kings 11)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:10:45.005985134Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}